{"kind": "weekly", "period": "2026-W46", "prepared_on": "2026-11-14", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📅 本週 AI 新聞回顧 · 2026-11-08 ～ 2026-11-14</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Jensen Huang resigns as Nvidia CEO, effective immediately; CFO Colette Kress named interim CEO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳辭去 Nvidia 執行長，立即生效，財務長 Colette Kress 接任臨時執行長</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia's board announced Huang's resignation as president, CEO and director, and appointed its first chairman. Shares fell as much as 10% at the open, pushing market value below $4 trillion while AMD jumped 27%.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 董事會宣布黃仁勳辭去總裁、執行長與董事職位，並任命首任董事長。開盤股價一度重挫 10%、市值跌破 4 兆美元，對手 AMD 則大漲 27%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180472\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Microsoft 365 Crawls Back to Life After a 24-Hour Outage<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Microsoft 365 在長達 24 小時的全球大當機後逐步恢復</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Microsoft says a bad update, not a cyberattack or AI, crashed its servers around the world. The outage hit Exchange Online, Teams, SharePoint and Copilot.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">微軟表示是錯誤更新造成全球伺服器當機，並非網路攻擊或 AI 所致。受影響服務包含 Exchange Online、Teams、SharePoint 與 Copilot。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/microsoft-365-crawls-back-to-life-after-a-24-hour-outage/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google rolls out Gemini 4 Hydrogen, finally replacing 3.8 Flash<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 推出 Gemini 4 Hydrogen，正式取代 3.8 Flash</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Hydrogen isn't getting a slow, security-conscious release like Carbon and Argon. It powers AI Mode with better handling of complex, multi-part queries.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gemini 4 Hydrogen 不像 Carbon 與 Argon 採緩慢、重視安全的發布方式。它驅動 AI Mode，更擅長處理複雜、多段式的問題。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/google/2026/11/google-rolls-out-gemini-4-hydrogen-finally-replacing-3-8-flash/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Introducing ChatGPT Wallet<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">推出 ChatGPT Wallet</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A secure way for agents in ChatGPT Work, Codex and dots to complete purchases with user approval and existing card protections. It starts as a limited rollout to US Pro subscribers.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">讓 ChatGPT Work、Codex 與 dots 中的代理人，在使用者核准並沿用現有信用卡保障下完成購買。首波限量開放給美國 Pro 訂閱者。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-wallet\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Export-banned Nvidia chips are behind China's most powerful AI models<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">遭出口禁令的 Nvidia 晶片，支撐了中國最強的 AI 模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">New research shows the most advanced AI models from China were trained on banned Nvidia chips. The finding lands as Congress opens investigations into Nvidia's China sales.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">新研究顯示，中國最先進的 AI 模型是用遭禁運的 Nvidia 晶片訓練的。國會也正針對 Nvidia 的對中銷售展開調查。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/13/export-banned-nvidia-chips-are-behind-chinas-most-powerful-ai-models-uh-oh-jensen/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Windows 0-day dropped by disgruntled researcher hands hackers System rights<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">心懷不滿的研究員公開 Windows 零時差漏洞，可取得 System 權限</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The \"SignDrop\" exploit lets local users gain all-powerful System rights on Windows.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">名為「SignDrop」的漏洞利用程式，可讓本機使用者在 Windows 上取得最高的 System 權限。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/windows-0-day-dropped-by-disgruntled-researcher-hands-hackers-system-rights/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Introducing AlphaProof Code: a breakthrough in verifying complex software at depth<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AlphaProof Code 問世：深度驗證複雜軟體的突破</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">AlphaProof Code agents wrote three million lines of proofs in Lean to verify Signal's core encryption.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">AlphaProof Code 代理人以 Lean 寫下三百萬行證明，用來驗證 Signal 的核心加密。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-alphaproof-code/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> AI agent startup LangChain hits $3B valuation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 代理新創 LangChain 估值達 30 億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">LangChain now claims 7,000 customers of LangSmith, its model- and platform-agnostic agent management tool.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">LangChain 表示其不限模型與平台的代理管理工具 LangSmith 已有 7,000 家客戶。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/13/ai-agent-startup-langchain-hits-3b-valuation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> Claude's Duet agent is a little neurotic and surprisingly helpful<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude 的 Duet 代理有點神經質，卻出乎意料地好用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Claude Duet is Anthropic's AI agent for consumers, the latest attempt to convince people who don't write code that agents can be useful.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Claude Duet 是 Anthropic 面向一般消費者的 AI 代理，是業界再一次說服不寫程式的人「代理很有用」的嘗試。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1032518/claude-duet-ai-agent-hands-on\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> FAA expands AI advice to manage air traffic congestion across entire US airspace<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">FAA 將 AI 建議工具擴大到全美空域，用於管理空中交通壅塞</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Airlines praised the AI tool, but the air traffic controllers' union wasn't involved in the rollout.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">航空公司稱讚這項 AI 工具，但航管員工會並未參與這次推行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/features/2026/11/faa-expands-ai-advice-to-manage-air-traffic-congestion-across-entire-us-airspace/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}